WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:03.086
Hello, uh, I am Tom Hiddleston
and

00:00:03.086 --> 00:00:07.633
I would like to give you a
tour of the set of The Essex
Serpent.

00:00:07.633 --> 00:00:13.639
♪♪

00:00:13.639 --> 00:00:14.848
Our story...

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:16.850
(Banging noises in background)

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.685
(Chuckles)

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:20.020
Just hold, hold for a second.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.021
♪♪

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:23.607
Tom Hiddleston:
Our story is set in Victorian
England

00:00:23.607 --> 00:00:26.860
Tom Hiddleston:
and split between London and
Essex.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.237
♪♪

00:00:28.237 --> 00:00:31.990
Tom Hiddleston:
We spent the first seven weeks
of principle photography

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:34.326
Tom Hiddleston:
on location with our chill
heaters and our wellies,

00:00:34.326 --> 00:00:35.744
trying to dodge the tide.

00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:36.912
♪♪

00:00:36.912 --> 00:00:40.040
It's been a lot of trudging
through mud.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:44.044
Battling the elements has felt
like a contact sport.

00:00:44.253 --> 00:00:47.756
Tom Hiddleston:
The Essex landscape is going to
be absolutely stunning.

00:00:47.756 --> 00:00:50.676
♪♪

00:00:50.676 --> 00:00:53.720
Tom Hiddleston:
In Essex, we needed a very
wintery atmosphere.

00:00:54.388 --> 00:00:58.016
Now that it's springtime, we are
inside filming our interiors

00:00:58.016 --> 00:01:00.060
Tom Hiddleston:
on a soundstage in Enfield.

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:02.104
♪♪

00:01:02.104 --> 00:01:06.608
What is amazing about a set like
this, is we're in North London,

00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:08.944
the real house was in Essex.

00:01:09.486 --> 00:01:11.071
Tom Hiddleston:
But as soon as you walk in here 

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:14.741
Tom Hiddleston:
you're back in the imagined
world of where the story takes place.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:18.412
This canvas that you see that
wraps around the set,

00:01:18.537 --> 00:01:20.956
Tom Hiddleston:
actually has projected upon it

00:01:20.956 --> 00:01:24.626
the exact photographic
replication of where we were in
Essex.

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:28.755
What I love about this, is this
is where we had our chickens

00:01:29.047 --> 00:01:32.384
Tom Hiddleston:
and Dixie and Ryan and
I decided to name all the chickens.

00:01:32.384 --> 00:01:34.720
Tom Hiddleston:
Ryan wanted to name one of them
Jeff.

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:36.596
I don't know if that's relevant,
but I thought you'd like to
know.

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:40.183
Forgive me, these are rather
unreal gardens.

00:01:40.183 --> 00:01:42.311
♪♪

00:01:42.311 --> 00:01:44.021
This is Will's study.

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:47.899
Will is the vicar and the
reverend of Aldwinter.

00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:49.901
♪♪

00:01:49.901 --> 00:01:52.571
Tom Hiddleston:
On this desk, there are all
sorts of texts

00:01:52.571 --> 00:01:54.072
Tom Hiddleston:
that represent Will's faith.

00:01:54.072 --> 00:01:56.408
Tom Hiddleston:
There's a psalm book, the
enormous bible on the side there.

00:01:56.408 --> 00:01:57.576
♪♪

00:01:57.576 --> 00:02:00.662
On this box there's a dragon
with a snake's tail

00:02:00.662 --> 00:02:04.291
and maybe that's a depiction of
the Essex Serpent from folklore.

00:02:04.291 --> 00:02:05.876
♪♪

00:02:05.876 --> 00:02:09.880
This one I love. Will has a
spaniel called Pup which I have
a soft spot for.

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:13.216
And the art department, they
gave me a matchbox with a
little spaniel.

00:02:13.216 --> 00:02:13.925
(Chuckle)

00:02:13.925 --> 00:02:15.385
Don't know if you'll see it in
production but

00:02:16.053 --> 00:02:17.137
at least I know it's there.

00:02:17.137 --> 00:02:19.139
♪♪

00:02:19.139 --> 00:02:21.975
Tom Hiddleston:
As an actor, it's so inspiring,

00:02:21.975 --> 00:02:25.395
Tom Hiddleston:
cus you walk into a space
you've imagined the world in your mind

00:02:25.395 --> 00:02:26.813
Tom Hiddleston:
but it's been built for you.

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:29.399
Tom Hiddleston:
And all you have to do is
inhabit it.

00:02:29.399 --> 00:02:31.526
Tom Hiddleston:
It's a real gift from the
designers.

00:02:31.526 --> 00:02:32.611
♪♪

